      "geometry": "rect",
      "lineWidth": 0,
      "text": "/* kalloc(): remove one free page */\nacquire(&kmem.lock);\nr = kmem.freelist;\nif (r) kmem.freelist = r->next;\nrelease(&kmem.lock);\n\n/* kfree(): add one free page */\nacquire(&kmem.lock);\nr->next = kmem.freelist;\nkmem.freelist = r;\nrelease(&kmem.lock);",
